      "statement": "I2C devices are addressed as BNO055=0x28, BME680(indoor)=0x76, BME280/BME260(outdoor)=0x77, INA226=0x40 (A0/A1=GND), PCF8523=0x68, all on a shared 100 kHz bus at SDA=GPIO16, SCL=GPIO15.",
