      "id": "claim_59dfffa216d04b85bb5d260633fdaa80",
      "statement": "Battery and tank analog inputs are fixed to GPIO4/ADC channel 3 (Battery1/vehicle), GPIO5/channel 4 (Battery2/house), GPIO1/channel 0 (Tank1 fresh, 100L), GPIO2/channel 1 (Tank2 grey, 92L); batteries use a 100kΩ/22kΩ divider (factor 122/22) while tank sensors (Votronic, 0-1V) connect directly to the ADC.",
